自分を許せない 誰よりも強い君以外は認めない
I can't forgive myself. I won't accept anyone other than you, who are stronger than anyone.

405
00:51:37,130 --> 00:51:42,630
誰もが信じ崇めてる まさに最強で無敵のアイドル
Everyone believes and worships you, truly the strongest and invincible idol.

406
00:51:42,630 --> 00:51:48,530
弱点なんて見当たらない 一番星を宿している
Not a single weakness in sight, holding the morning star within.

407
00:51:48,630 --> 00:51:54,130
弱いとこなんて見せちゃダメダメ 知りたくないとこは見せずに
You mustn't show any weak spots, without showing places people don't want to know,

408
00:51:54,130 --> 00:51:57,330
唯一無二じゃなくちゃイヤイヤ
If you aren't one and only, no way!

409
00:51:57,330 --> 00:52:00,430
それこそ本物のアイ
That precisely is true love.

410
00:52:00,530 --> 00:52:04,530
得意の笑顔で沸かすメディア 隠しきるこの秘密だけは
The media excited by your signature smile, only this secret you conceal completely

411
00:52:04,530 --> 00:52:07,630
愛してるって嘘で積むキャリア
Is a career woven with the lie of 'I love you'.

412
00:52:07,630 --> 00:52:13,230
これこそ私なりの愛だ 流れる汗も綺麗なアクア
This is my kind of love; the flowing sweat is also a beautiful aqua.

413
00:52:13,230 --> 00:52:16,530
ルビーを隠したこの瞼 歌い踊り舞う私はマリア
This eyelid hiding a ruby, singing, dancing, and twirling, I am Maria.

414
00:52:16,530 --> 00:52:20,030
そう嘘はとびきりの愛だ
Yes, lies are supreme love.

415
00:52:24,830 --> 00:52:34,630
誰かに愛されたことも 誰かのこと愛したこともない
I've never been loved by anyone, nor have I ever loved anyone.

416
00:52:34,630 --> 00:52:37,430
そんな私の嘘が いつか本当になること
Hoping that my lies like these will someday become the truth,

417
00:52:37,430 --> 00:52:39,530
信じてる
I believe.

418
00:52:39,530 --> 00:52:45,130
いつかきっと全部手に入れる 私はそう欲張りなアイドル
Someday I'll surely get everything; I am such a greedy idol.

419
00:52:45,130 --> 00:52:50,930
等身大でみんなのこと ちゃんと愛したいから
Because I want to truly love everyone with my real self,

420
00:52:50,930 --> 00:52:56,930
今日も嘘をつくの この言葉がいつか本当になる日を願って
Today too I tell lies, wishing for the day these words will truly come true.

421
00:52:56,930 --> 00:53:03,630
それでもまだ 君と君にだけは言えずにいたけど
Even so, I still couldn't say it to you and only you...

422
00:53:03,630 --> 00:53:06,130
ああ やっと言えた
Ah, I finally said it.

423
00:53:06,130 --> 00:53:22,080
これは絶対嘘じゃない 愛してる
This is definitely not a lie. I love you.

424
00:53:45,430 --> 00:53:57,330
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ 呼び合う声を合図に
Parade, parade, parade! Shining brightly, taking our calling voices as a signal

425
00:53:59,430 --> 00:54:04,830
Parade, parade, parade! 探しにゆく スタートは何度だって
Parade, parade, parade! Going out to search, starting over as many times as it takes.

426
00:54:05,530 --> 00:54:10,630
ただ 独り言を綴った ただ 始まりたくて 走った
Just whispering to myself alone, just running because I wanted it to begin

427
00:54:10,630 --> 00:54:15,030
それは 優し過ぎる思い出 もっと 近づけと 手を伸ばした
That memory was too kind, so I reached out my hand to get closer

428
00:54:22,630 --> 00:54:29,930
いぇい！2つ目の衣装はこれだ！ ジャケットも！わーい！
Yay! The second outfit is this! And the jacket too! Yay!

429
00:54:32,030 --> 00:54:36,630
ただ 独り言を綴った ただ 始まりたくて 走った
Just whispering to myself alone, just running because I wanted it to begin

430
00:54:41,630 --> 00:54:46,130
遠く 暗がりに灯った それは 眩し過ぎた名前
Lighting up far away in the dark, that name was too dazzling.

431
00:54:46,930 --> 00:54:52,130
それは 優し過ぎる思い出 もっと 近づけと 手を伸ばした
That memory was too kind, so I reached out my hand to get closer

432
00:55:00,176 --> 00:55:06,928
思いがけず 結び合った ほら 今 迷子は「僕等」になった
