まだ 頼りない予感を
Unreliable premonitions...

438
00:55:53,124 --> 00:55:57,284
歌おう 恥ずかしくなんてないよ
Let's sing them, there's nothing to be embarrassed about!

439
00:55:57,964 --> 00:56:07,484
誰も解けないイマジナリー いつかまた逢える おまじない
An imaginary that no one can solve, a charm so we can meet again someday...

440
00:56:08,664 --> 00:56:18,604
あの日 ゼロに始まったストーリー 数え切れない言の葉 数えるような 想いじゃないさ
That story that started at zero on that day—innumerable words, not feelings just to be counted.

441
00:56:19,104 --> 00:56:23,844
ほら 今「僕等」を一つと呼ぼう
Look, now let's call "us" as one!

442
00:56:24,364 --> 00:56:33,364
Parade, parade, parade! 美しいんだよ 許し合える刹那 夜はきらめく
Parade, parade, parade! It's so beautiful—the moment we can forgive each other, the night sparkles.

443
00:56:34,504 --> 00:56:42,264
雨 晴れ カレイド またとない空
Rain, clear skies, kaleidoscope, a once-in-a-lifetime sky...

444
00:56:42,724 --> 00:56:46,164
君と在ることさ
Being with you...

445
00:56:46,424 --> 00:56:52,424
君と在ることなんだ
Yes, it is being together with you!

446
00:56:52,904 --> 00:57:04,384
「ただいま」を聞けば「おかえり」って叫ぶよ 当たり前じゃないか
