447
00:57:06,364 --> 00:57:16,204
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ 暗がりを満たすのは 君だ 僕だ！
Parade, parade, parade! Shining bright, what fills the darkness is you, it's me!

448
00:57:17,564 --> 00:57:25,644
Parade, parade, parade! 輝くんだよ 悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいで
Parade, parade, parade! Shining bright, bring along your frustrations and your affection!

449
