452
00:57:42,964 --> 00:57:51,444
ここから これから Our bright parade, parade!
From here, from now on, our bright parade, parade!

453
00:57:51,664 --> 00:58:01,444
Our bright parade, parade!

454
00:58:10,588 --> 00:58:13,288
